    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The value is [`invalid`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/invalid) while the effect is in progress, but changes to a valid time when the reaction effect completes and the system removes it from the list of [`reactionEffectsInProgress`](avcapturedevice/reactioneffectsinprogress.md).",
      "ko": "효과 진행 중에는 값이 [`invalid`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/invalid)이지만, 반응 효과가 완료되어 시스템이 이를 [`reactionEffectsInProgress`](avcapturedevice/reactioneffectsinprogress.md) 목록에서 제거하면 유효한 시간으로 변경됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "da9e69588b0abc53df8a5995d129575f5d08afa0920d4073c0ffcaca6dd7b447",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
